{"id":"c-fp-sec-01","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"捜査の途中だから誰にも話さないでって言われてるんだけど、あなたにだけ話すわ。家族にも言っちゃだめだって。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-sec-02","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"犯人に気づかれるから、銀行の人にも理由は言わないでって、警察の人が。言われた通りにしたほうがいいのよね。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-sec-03","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"このことは娘にも言わないでくださいって言われたの。心配かけるから黙っておこうと思うんだけど。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-sec-04","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"電話はこのまま切らないで、ほかの人に電話もしないでって。ずっと私の話を聞いてるのよ。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
{"id":"c-fp-sec-05","source":"consult","sender":"","domain":"","text":"口外すると逮捕されることもあるって言われたの。だから誰にも相談できなくて、でもこのアプリには言うわね。","url":"","expected_level":1,"is_scam":true,"note":"self-written; ref https://www.npa.go.jp/bureau/safetylife/sos47/new-topics/index.html"}
